+++++Subject: [PATCH 6/8] fix(doctor): accept skill directories, not just files
+++++
+++++Skills are directories containing SKILL.md, but doctor_check_skills
+++++tested with [[ ! -f "$resolved" ]] which failed for every skill,
+++++producing 51 false-positive 'Skill file missing' failures. Now accept
